body: "Implement from Core 2026.8.0 schemas and installed dependency types. Use top-level imports, erasable TypeScript, no any, no dynamic imports, no trivial one-use wrappers, and no source file over 300 code lines. Normalize and sort upstream sets; bound per-type output; preserve generic passthrough; never retain raw live values."
